---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import apoorva from '../assets/apoorva.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Apoorva"
	description="Product manager and 0-to-1 builder across pharma, insurance and food-tech in India and Europe."
	pubDate={new Date('September 03 2026')}
>
	<Image src={apoorva} alt="Apoorva Pothula" width={280} height={280} class="avatar avatar-center" />
	<p>
		I'm a product manager with seven years of experience across e-pharmacy, insurance, food delivery
		and quick commerce, in India and Europe. I'm drawn to the messy, ambiguous early stage of a
		product — I've been the 0-to-1 builder behind several industry firsts, including India's first
		GLP-1 weight-loss medicine, its first OPD insurance product, and its first multi-brand cloud
		kitchen. I hold an MBA from IIM Indore, and I'm happiest owning conversion and retention funnels
		end to end. Outside work, I'm an avid techie and board gamer, always up for a quirky side project.
	</p>

	<h2>Novo Nordisk — Product Manager, GLP-1 Commercial Partnerships</h2>
	<p><em>Bengaluru · 2024 – present</em></p>
	<p>
		Novo Nordisk is the global leader in diabetes and obesity care, behind the Ozempic and Wegovy
		brands in the GLP-1 weight-loss segment in India.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			Led a pod of five to establish Novo Nordisk's first-ever partnerships product charter for
			access to quality weight-management care — scaled to ₹27 Cr ARR across 12+ omnichannel partners.
		</li>
		<li>
			Improved discovery and lead generation across Tata 1mg, Apollo 24|7 and PharmEasy through
			widgets, banners and short-form education content, increasing new patient starts by 46%.
		</li>
		<li>
			Grew e-pharmacy GLP-1 penetration 2x in six months with omni-channel patient education journeys
			covering treatment suitability, how GLP-1s work, expected outcomes, dosage and administration.
		</li>
		<li>
			Built the end-to-end purchase journey connecting customers to counsellors and doctors online,
			lifting Wegovy sales 31%.
		</li>
		<li>
			Introduced a Patient Support App for medication guidance, diet consultations, lifestyle content
			and affordability support — improving retention 3x (from two to six months) and moving 18% of
			partner-channel customers to a native D2C funnel.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Kenko Health — Growth Product Lead, Founder's Office</h2>
	<p><em>Bengaluru · 2022 – 2024</em></p>
	<p>
		India's first insurance product to cover both IPD and OPD care, with a fully in-house stack across
		selling, underwriting and claims management.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			Led acquisition and retention funnels across insurance, claims, diagnostics and medicines —
			owning discovery, conversion and engagement.
		</li>
		<li>
			Launched a cashless claim and hospitalization product for out-of-network hospitals, built on the
			UPI stack.
		</li>
		<li>
			Built a global Elasticsearch search experience indexing products across names, descriptions,
			aliases, prices and other attributes.
		</li>
		<li>
			Shipped a one-click prescription-to-cart feature using an AI vision model fine-tuned on local
			prescriptions and purchase data, reaching 97% order accuracy through evaluation and guardrails.
		</li>
		<li>
			Stood up the analytics and engagement stack on Mixpanel and CleverTap, driving continuous
			product discovery and experimentation.
		</li>
		<li>
			Built an inside-sales engine integrating Zoho CRM, Ozonetel and WhatsApp workflows to recover
			high-intent users.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Rebel Foods (Faasos) & Curb Foods — Platform Product Manager</h2>
	<p><em>Bengaluru & Stockholm · 2019 – 2022</em></p>
	<p>
		Pioneers in the food-delivery and quick-commerce space across India and Europe, and the exclusive
		food-delivery fulfilment partner of Flink.
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li>
			Owned the kitchen operations platform for cloud kitchens across India and Europe, serving both
			in-house and marketplace quick-commerce and food-delivery orders.
		</li>
		<li>
			Built real-time menu integration and combo ordering for food + grocery carts, alongside search,
			category navigation, recommendations and cart drop-off journeys.
		</li>
		<li>
			Rebuilt the Kitchen Management Platform to run the full order lifecycle — inventory planning,
			preparation sequencing, TAT tracking, packaging and rider handover in one unified workflow.
		</li>
		<li>
			Built a centralized Menu Management Platform as the CMS for listings, recipes, ingredients,
			pricing and promotions.
		</li>
		<li>
			Added audit logs and approval workflows so both platforms cleared ITGC audits, then
			commercialized them as SaaS products.
		</li>
		<li>Started as an individual contributor at Rebel Foods in India before moving to Curb Foods in Stockholm.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Education</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>MBA, Strategy &amp; Marketing</strong> — Indian Institute of Management Indore, 2020</li>
		<li><strong>Exchange Programme, Tech &amp; Management Studies</strong> — NEOMA Business School, France, 2019</li>
		<li><strong>B.Tech, Electronics &amp; Telecommunications</strong> — College of Engineering Pune (COEP), 2017</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Skills</h2>
	<p>
		Product strategy · product discovery · search · recommendation engines · machine learning · LLMs
		&amp; LangChain · AI evals · SQL · Python · Mixpanel · CleverTap · Zoho · rapid prototyping.
	</p>

